<title>UK: Panama soybean carrier to leave New Orleans Apr 17.</title>
<headline>Panama soybean carrier to leave New Orleans Apr 17.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Repairs to the Panamanian bulk carrier Megalodoxi at New Orleans are expected to be completed on April 11, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 63,822 dwt bulker is expected to load cargo from river barges April 12-16 and sail on April 17.</p>
<p>Megalodoxi had a cargo of soybeans on board when it was towed to New Orleans with rudder damage. The cargo was offloaded at the port.</p>
</text>
